  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide integrated food and nutritional assistance to crisis affected populations to support their self-reliance and recovery needs and provide humanitarian air services in cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this award is to provide financial support to WFP to target 164,572 people for a program entitled provide integrated food and nutritional assistance to crisis affected populations to support their self-reliance and recovery needs and provide humanitarian air services in cameroon. WFP plans to cover two activities of the csp: i) providing integrated food and nutritional assistance to refugees, idps, vulnerable host populations and returnees in the six crisis affected regions of cameroon: far north region covering the lake Chad basin crisis, north-west and south-west regions covering the sociopolitical crisis and east, adamawa and north covering the car crisis; ii) providing humanitarian air services (UNHAS) in cameroon.</narrative>
  </description>
